<title>USA: Hi-Lo Automotive Q4 share loss widens.</title>
<headline>Hi-Lo Automotive Q4 share loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				Three months ended December</p>
<p>			    1996		  1995</p>
<p> Shr		 loss     $0.17 loss   $0.11</p>
<p> Net		 loss     1,800 loss   1,200</p>
<p> Sales			 56,300	 59,100</p>
<p>					 Year</p>
<p> Shr		 loss     $4.99	  $0.16</p>
<p> Net		 loss    53,700	  1,700</p>
<p> Sales			248,600	262,500</p>
<p>NOTE: Net loss for 1966 gives effect to third quarter pre-tax charge of $59.4 million. The company said it does not expect similar charges in the future, based on current industry trends and its operating environment.</p>
<p>Hi-Lo Automotive Inc.</p>
<p>--(New York Newsdesk, 212 859-1610)</p>
